# This Vercel project exists only to preview the content marketing page, so
# everything else in the repo is kept out of the deployment.
#
# Code.gs and lead-confirmation-email.gs carry the leads spreadsheet ID and
# must never be served as static files. The mobile app page is still live on
# Hostinger and posts to the live lead endpoint, so it stays out of this
# deployment until its own Vercel project exists.
#
# Patterns follow gitignore rules, so an unanchored name matches at every
# level. Keep that in mind before adding a bare filename here: an earlier
# unanchored "index.html" also matched content-marketing/index.html and left
# the deployment with nothing to serve at the root.

